      "comparison": "Opened final corrected PNG and 15/01 references. Three full panels preserve turquoise background, white cards, friendly illustrations, peach disclaimer and primary/secondary hierarchy. Read all AZ copy: inactive 30/90 minutes; active 30–50 at 5–7 km/h plus 45 cycling and 40 doubles tennis; very-active 45 cycling, 25 at 10 km/h and 60 doubles tennis. Repeated conjunction corrected. No clipping observed. All three disclaimers and confirmation/other/uncertain actions visible. Pixel contrast, native accessibility/localization and user approval remain unverified."
